  "description": "Seowoo falls in love at first sight with Lee Chungha, a hyung in his church. His abrupt confession is met with rejection because Chungha doesn't want to date a kid. Chungha tells him he'll reconsider it when he turns twenty, so Seowoo blindly believes it and follows him to college. However, he has absolutely no idea how Chungha actually feels…\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000052725), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12253646), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/stole_my_heart)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://honto.jp/ebook/pd-series_C-MBJ-21782-1-608901X.html)",
